# Copy to .env.local (gitignored) and fill in a real value.
#
# Google Maps SDK for Android — required for SearchMapView.tsx's real
# MapView to render at all (its absence is checked at runtime and falls
# back to a placeholder instead of crashing — see PROJECT.md's ADR log).
# Get one: Google Cloud Console > enable "Maps SDK for Android" > Credentials
# > Create API key. Requires billing enabled on the Cloud project.
#
# Once set, this alone only flips the JS-level placeholder off — the key
# still needs wiring into app.json's android.config.googleMaps.apiKey (and
# a native rebuild) for the actual AndroidManifest.xml to have it too.
EXPO_PUBLIC_GOOGLE_MAPS_API_KEY=
